{{Term/Store|Swift Violet|Swift Violets|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Swift Violet}}
Swift Violets grow on cliffsides in the [[Gerudo Highlands]] and [[Hebra Mountains]]. They are also available to purchase at the [[Coral Reef]] in [[Zora's Domain]]. When Swift Violets are [[Cooking|Cooked]] into a [[Meal]] using a [[Cooking Pot]], the resulting dish will grant [[Link]] the [[Speed Up]] [[Added Effect]] when eaten, which temporarily increases his movement speed.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can also be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] to make Purple [[Dye]].

